This full version of `App.tsx` correctly orders the `addEchoMessage` and `addArtifact` functions to prevent reference errors, and restores all the application logic, including the new `ChronicleReliquaryPanel`, `CommunityResonancePanel`, and `VoidEtchingOverlay`.

