To fulfill the request "Put the dream bloom in the system tab", I will move the **Codex Dream Panel** (which is the primary visualizer often associated with the "Dreambloom Pulse" mode) from the **Center Column ("Weave")** to the **Right Column ("System")**.

This reorganization balances the layout, as the Center Column is currently quite heavy with the Ritual Canvas, Profile Weaver, Community Panel, and Reliquary. Placing the Dream Panel in the System tab treats it as a "System State Visualizer" alongside the Entropy Heart and L.I.F.E. Monitor.

I will dynamically adjust its `width` prop to ensure it fits within the narrower sidebar on desktop screens while remaining full-width on mobile.

